---
// Interactive Tax Savings Widget for Information Gain
---

<div class="calculator-widget" style="margin: 2.5rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-focus); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🧮</span>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin: 0;">2026 연금계좌(IRP/연금저축) 세액공제 예상 환급액 계산기</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.825rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">연간 납입액과 총급여에 따른 예상 연말정산 환급금을 즉시 시뮬레이션합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
    <div>
      <label for="salary-select" style="display: block; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
        총급여(연봉) 구간
      </label>
      <select id="salary-select" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); background: var(--bg-main); color: var(--text-main); font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        <option value="0.165">5,500만 원 이하 (공제율 16.5%)</option>
        <option value="0.132">5,500만 원 초과 (공제율 13.2%)</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="deposit-amount" style="display: block; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
        연간 총 납입액 (최대 900만 원)
      </label>
      <select id="deposit-amount" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); background: var(--bg-main); color: var(--text-main); font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        <option value="3000000">300만 원 (월 25만 원)</option>
        <option value="6000000">600만 원 (연금저축 단독 한도)</option>
        <option value="9000000" selected>900만 원 (연금저축+IRP 합산 최대 한도)</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="background: var(--primary-light); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
    <div>
      <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">내년 2월 예상 연말정산 환급금</span>
      <div id="refund-result" style="font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        1,485,000 원
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: right;">
      * 지방소득세 10% 포함 기준<br>
      * 실제 환급액은 결정세액 한도 내 적용
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  const salarySelect = document.getElementById('salary-select');
  const depositSelect = document.getElementById('deposit-amount');
  const refundResult = document.getElementById('refund-result');

  function calculateTaxRefund() {
    const rate = parseFloat(salarySelect.value);
    const deposit = parseInt(depositSelect.value, 10);
    const refund = Math.round(deposit * rate);
    refundResult.textContent = refund.toLocaleString('ko-KR') + ' 원';
  }

  salarySelect?.addEventListener('change', calculateTaxRefund);
  depositSelect?.addEventListener('change', calculateTaxRefund);
</script>
